  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: b8c5f8bea1b438d4687ad9b712e77c3e, type: 3}
  m_Name: Level 1-2 Starting Cutscene
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::CutsceneData
  line:
  - speakerName: Jose Rizal
    speakerType: 0
    hero: {fileID: 0}
    enemy: {fileID: 0}
    Dialogue: "When I first woke up as a baby, I found myself in a village. I felt
      the sun and heard the voices of my parents. After that, I don\u2019t remember
      much from my baby days."
    isLeftSide: 0
  - speakerName: Jose Rizal
    speakerType: 0
    hero: {fileID: 0}
    enemy: {fileID: 0}
    Dialogue: In my time when I was a child, is probably where I formed my habits.
      I remember the gloomy nights that passed by on the roof of our house. On moonlit
      nights, I took my supper at the roof of the house. My nurse, who was very fond
      of me, used to threaten to leave me to terrible but imaginary beings if I did
      not eat.
    isLeftSide: 0
  - speakerName: Jose Rizal
    speakerType: 0
    hero: {fileID: 0}
    enemy: {fileID: 0}
    Dialogue: My memories of that time... I'm remembering some of them.
    isLeftSide: 0
